    "cmd": "cd code && python explore_data.py"
  }
}
```

Good! The script ran and generated plots. I can see there are anomalies at times 80 and 121 minutes. The warning about log is because some temperature differences might be negative or zero. Let me check the images were created and then think about the modeling approach.

