There's an error with the color format. Let me fix it.

```json
{
  "tool": "edit_file",
  "args": {
    "path": "code/final_analysis.py",
    "old_str": "        # Add residual subplot\n        plt.subplot(2, 2, 4)\n        plt.plot(seg_data['time_rel'], residuals, seg['color']+'.', \n                markersize=5, alpha=0.6, label=seg['name'])",
    "new_str": "        # Add residual subplot\n        plt.subplot(2, 2, 4)\n        plt.plot(seg_data['time_rel'], residuals, '.', color=seg['color'], \n                markersize=5, alpha=0.6, label=seg['name'])"
