I see the issue - the report uses numbered sections (1., 2., etc.) instead of the section names I was checking for. Let me update the verification to check for numbered sections or fix the report. Actually, the report looks fine - it uses numbered sections (1., 2., 3., etc.) which is standard academic formatting. Let me check the report content quickly to make sure it's complete.

```json
{
  "tool": "read_file",
